		"FinalText": {
			"id": 1020,
			"code": "FinalText",
			"text": "I won't hide it - we are defeated and downcast. You destroyed a demon, on the resurrection of which we expended a lot of effort and placed all our hopes. Stupid philanthropy caused you to stand in the way of a grand plan, the greatness of which was too much for your feeble mind to grasp. Only long years of contemplation and a certain amount of knowledge, to which you do not have access, would help you realize your mistake. However, we are also to blame for our failure. We never even thought we could encounter a mortal capable of resisting the higher demons. Not to worry, next time we will avoid any similar mistakes, and nothing will prevent the rebirth process. ^^ Every cloud has a silver lining - thanks to you we have experienced a long forgotten feeling of surprise. As a reward for this we will reveal our name to you: we are the Masks. Remember us, for we will not forget you."
		},
